5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this with wisdom and care. I believe we should examine the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. I think it would be helpful to look into the national computing agreement and facility day rates, as well as the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm excited to help! I want to check the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation. I think it's important to see how the equipment is doing!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure our investment isn't derailed by administrative friction, I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the station records from partner field sites.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the closeout files of finished awards and the national repository deposit turnaround. It is important to see what was actually delivered.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,"I am content with my choices. It is often the quiet, steady hands that sustain the grandest visions. I look forward to hearing your perspectives as we uncover the truth together.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,I agree. It is wonderful to have such a diverse set of priorities among us. I believe our combined findings will give us a very balanced view of the current landscape.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm just so curious to see what we find! I hope the shared facilities are in great shape so the researchers can do their best work. Let's do this!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, a comprehensive approach is always the most elegant. I suspect the gaps between planning and execution often hide the most interesting stories. I shall await the results with a certain degree of anticipation.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
